    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "- Dung d\u1ECBch ti\xEAm: Cordarone 150 mg/3 ml\n- Ph\xF2ng v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u
    tr\u1ECB r\u1ED1i lo\u1EA1n nh\u1ECBp tim n\u1EB7ng. Ng\u1EEBng tim do rung th\u1EA5t
    \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC1 kh\xE1ng v\u1EDBi shock \u0111i\u1EC7n ngo\xE0i l\u1ED3ng
    ng\u1EF1c\n- Ch\u1ED1ng ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh: Qu\xE1 m\u1EABn v\u1EDBi iod
    ho\u1EB7c Amiodarone; c\u01B0\u1EDDng tuy\u1EBFn gi\xE1p, h\u1EA1 huy\u1EBFt \xE1p
    tr\u1EA7m tr\u1ECDng, nh\u1ECBp tim ch\u1EADm qu\xE1 m\u1EE9c; ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF
    c\xF3 thai t\u1EEB th\xE1ng th\u1EE9 4 c\u1EE7a thai k\u1EF3, ph\u1EE5 n\u1EEF
    cho con b\xFA, tr\u1EBB < 3 tu\u1ED5i; d\xF9ng chung c\xE1c thu\u1ED1c g\xE2y
    xo\u1EAFn \u0111\u1EC9nh."
